// Update updates configurable fields on a session while preserving fields you omit. Use `title`, `metadata`, `agent`, or `budget` to change the corresponding session settings; only `tools` and `mcp_servers` can be updated in the agent configuration. `vault_ids` is reserved for future use and requests that set it are rejected.
